  "collectionName": "Asset Register SOPs",
  "summary": "How the dedicated Harness Register and certification reports work.",
  "sections": {
    "body": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>The Harness Register is a dedicated top-level view for rigging/fall-arrest harness equipment. It's kept separate from the general Asset Inventory because harnesses need certification-date tracking and a compliance-focused report that doesn't apply to other asset types.</p>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 566 74\" width=\"566\" height=\"74\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Open Harness\nRegister then Open a Harness's\nDetail Page then Generate\nCertification PDF\">\n<defs><marker id=\"arrow-3\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"var(--color-text-muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"91\" y=\"34\">Open Harness</tspan><tspan x=\"91\" y=\"48\">Register</tspan></text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"283\" y=\"34\">Open a Harness's</tspan><tspan x=\"283\" y=\"48\">Detail Page</tspan></text><rect x=\"396\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"475\" y=\"34\">Generate</tspan><tspan x=\"475\" y=\"48\">Certification PDF</tspan></text><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"197\" y2=\"37\" stroke=\"var(--color-text-muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-3)\"/><line x1=\"366\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"389\" y2=\"37\" stroke=\"var(--color-text-muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-3)\"/>\n</svg>\n<h2>Step-by-Step</h2>\n<ol><li>Open <strong>Harness Register</strong> from the sidebar to see every harness asset.</li><li>Click a harness to open its dedicated detail page.</li><li>Use the report action on that page to generate a certification PDF for inspection/compliance records.</li></ol>\n<h2>Tips</h2>\n<ul><li>If a new harness doesn't show up here, confirm it was added to the Asset Inventory under the \"Harness\" category.</li></ul>"
  },
